# AI assistant working directories. The instructions themselves are tracked --
# AGENTS.md, plus CLAUDE.md and GEMINI.md as symlinks to it -- because how this
# project is developed is part of its documentation. What is ignored here is the
# per-machine state a tool writes beside them: local settings, session history,
# caches.
.claude/
.gemini/

# Operating-system detritus.
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Editor and Python detritus
*~
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build trees.
/build*/

# Skies. A rendered sky is regenerable from its project file, and at full
# resolution it is tens of megabytes; the project file is what is kept. Images the
# documentation shows are the exception.
*.png
*.exr
*.ktx2
!website/static/**/*.png
*.hdr
*.pfm
!docs/**/*.png

# The website: its dependencies and build products
website/node_modules/
website/build/
website/.docusaurus/
